  "title": "Summer Zucchini Casserole",
  "description": "This casserole recipe with summer zucchini, stuffing mix, onions, and carrots is baked in cream of chicken soup, sour cream, and butter for a tasty meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Judy B"
  ],
